  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-formula-card\"><header><h3>global-permutation-pseudo-p</h3><span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--derived\" data-provenance=\"derived\">curated formula</span></header><div><pre class=\"lens-tex\">\\begin{aligned}\n\\term{pValue}{p}&amp;=\\frac{\\min\\left(m\\,(\\term{larger}{M}+1),\\;\\term{permutations}{P}+1\\right)}{\\term{permutations}{P}+1},\n&amp;\\term{larger}{M}&amp;=\\min(\\term{greater}{g},\\term{lesser}{l})\\\\\n\\term{greater}{g}&amp;=\\#\\{\\term{pairSum}{q_p}\\ge\\term{observedSum}{q_0}\\},\n&amp;\\term{lesser}{l}&amp;=\\#\\{\\term{pairSum}{q_p}\\le\\term{observedSum}{q_0}\\}\\\\\n\\term{observed}{s_0}&amp;=\\term{scale}{\\kappa}\\,\\term{observedSum}{q_0},\n&amp;\\term{zSimulated}{z}&amp;=\\frac{\\term{observed}{s_0}-\\term{mean}{\\bar{s}}}{\\term{standardDeviation}{\\sigma_s}}\n\\end{aligned}</pre><p class=\"lens-ascii\">p = min(m (M + 1), P + 1) / (P + 1); g = #{p in 1..P : q_p &gt;= q_0}, l = #{q_p &lt;= q_0}, where q_0 is the pair sum of the identity permutation and q_p that of permutation p; the default two-sided tail has m = 2 and M = min(g, l) (greater: m = 1, M = g; lesser: m = 1, M = l; folded: m = 1, M = #{|s_p - mean| &gt;= |s_0 - mean|}; directed: m = 1, M = min(g, l)). The statistic is s = kappa q with a positive constant kappa, so the counts compare identical f32 pair sums. z = (s_0 - mean) / sd of the P simulated statistics (esda z_sim). The p-value lies on the grid k/(P+1).</p></div><div class=\"lens-symbols\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.global-permutation-test-compiled:global-permutation-test-finalize\" data-value=\"pValue\">pValue · output · results</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.global-permutation-test-compiled:global-permutation-test-finalize\" data-value=\"larger\">exceedance count · intermediate · larger</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.global-permutation-test-compiled:global-permutation-test-finalize\" data-value=\"permutations\">permutations · parameter · permutations</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.global-permutation-test-compiled:global-permutation-test-finalize\" data-value=\"greater\">greater · intermediate · greater</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.global-permutation-test-compiled:global-permutation-test-finalize\" data-value=\"lesser\">lesser · intermediate · lesser</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.global-permutation-test-compiled:global-permutation-test-finalize\" data-value=\"pairSum\">pairSum · intermediate · pairSum</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.global-permutation-test-compiled:global-permutation-test-finalize\" data-value=\"observedSum\">observedSum · intermediate · observedSum</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.global-permutation-test-compiled:global-permutation-test-finalize\" data-value=\"observed\">observed · output · observed</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.global-permutation-test-compiled:spatial-weights-transform-row\" data-value=\"scale\">s